  "question": {
    "text": "For an amplitude modulated wave the minimum amplitude is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, while the modulation index is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. The maximum amplitude of the modulated wave is:"
  },
